23 0 obj
<< /A 1125 0 R /Alt (Charts displaying antibody levels and treatments for four cases. Each case shows antibody presence \(+ or negative\) over time measured in weeks, with treatments marked: Case 1 shows GM1 IgM, GM2 IgM, and sulfatides IgM; Case 2 shows GM2 IgG, GT1a IgG, and GQ1b IgG; Case 3 shows GM1 IgM; Case 4 shows general serum antibody levels. Treatments involve efgartigimod \(red triangles\), IVIG, and glucocorticoids, represented with colored bars. Results track antibody changes before and after efgartigimod treatment.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 18 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
24 0 obj
<< /A 1126 0 R /Alt (Three line graphs titled \215MRC,\216 \215GBS-DS,\216 and \215INCAT\216 show data for Cases 1 to 4 over time \(Baseline, 1 Week, 3 Weeks, 5 Weeks, 7 Weeks\). The \215MRC\216 graph shows increasing trends; \215GBS-DS\216 shows decreasing trends, particularly for Case 4; and \215INCAT\216 shows a decline for Case 3 while others remain stable or decrease slightly. Time is on the horizontal axis.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 19 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
